  "notes": "{惜|お}しむ expresses reluctance to part with something valued.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {別|わか}れを{惜|お}しむ: to regret parting\n- 〜を{惜|お}しまない: to not spare ~, to give generously\n- {惜|お}しみなく: unstintingly, generously\n- 〜が{惜|お}しい: it's a waste of ~\n\nVERB TYPE: Godan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし}), transitive\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {惜|お}しい (adjective): regrettable, precious\n- {惜|お}しげもなく: without hesitation, freely",
